WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.216 --> 00:00:02.799
(upbeat music)

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:24.602
- [Narrator] Here in this Saint Petersburg

00:00:24.602 --> 00:00:27.705
apartment building, you
can find Tatiana Subbotina,

00:00:27.705 --> 00:00:30.397
better known as The Green Screen Grandma.

00:00:30.397 --> 00:00:33.215
A retired engineer, Tatiana
has attracted a following

00:00:33.215 --> 00:00:36.440
creating some unique content for YouTube.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:38.658
(yelling)

00:00:38.658 --> 00:00:41.078
Tatiana's channel has
almost 30,000 subscribers

00:00:41.078 --> 00:00:44.245
and over two and a half million views.

00:00:48.513 --> 00:00:52.680
Surprising because Tatiana
is completely self taught.

00:01:16.265 --> 00:01:17.985
Once she graduated from puppetry,

00:01:17.985 --> 00:01:20.088
Tatiana's channel really took off.

00:01:20.088 --> 00:01:21.395
There was one video in particular

00:01:21.395 --> 00:01:25.395
that really propelled her
to the national stage.

00:01:54.365 --> 00:01:56.287
Despite her large and growing audience,

00:01:56.287 --> 00:01:59.454
Tatiana doesn't see herself as a star.

00:02:13.597 --> 00:02:17.764
A baby star now, but you
wanna be famous, don't you?

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:22.707
(upbeat music)

